src/oracle_test/locale/README

Locales
=======

This directory contains a set of tests for locales.  I provided one C
program test-ctype.c to test CTYPE support in libc and the installed
locale data.  Then there are test-sort.pl and test-sort.py that test
collating.

Run an individual locale test with `make oracle-check-<locale>` from this
directory, for example `make oracle-check-de_DE.ISO8859-1`.  These targets
use an installed server, so configure the usual connection environment
variables first.

For more detailed instructions, refer to the "README" file in the "src/test/locale" directory.
